ound, or choose the audio-node version when you want a separate effects track."},{"question":"How do I use Sonilo Video Sound Effects on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick Sonilo Video Sound Effects from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]},{"slug":"sonilo-video-music","name":"Sonilo Video Music","provider":"Sonilo","category":"video","releasedAt":"2026-07-30","categoryLabel":"Video model","tagline":"Add generated music directly to an existing video","description":"Sonilo Video Music creates a music track for a connected video and returns the video with music. Add an optional prompt to guide the soundtrack without regenerating the visuals.","capabilities":["Generate music for a connected video","Return the video with its generated soundtrack"],"searchAliases":[],"faq":[{"question":"What is Sonilo Video Music?","answer":"Sonilo Video Music creates a music track for a connected video and returns the video with music. Add an optional prompt to guide the soundtrack without regenerating the visuals."},{"question":"How do I use Sonilo Video Music on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick Sonilo Video Music from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]},{"slug":"heygen-avatar-iv","name":"HeyGen Avatar IV","provider":"HeyGen","category":"video","releasedAt":"2026-08-04","categoryLabel":"Video model","tagline":"Animate an avatar with a script or connected speech","description":"HeyGen Avatar IV creates avatar videos from text or audio inputs. Select it manually on a video node to pair a script or speech track with an avatar image.","capabilities":["Generate video from a text prompt","Drive a video from an input audio track"],"searchAliases":[],"faq":[{"question":"What is HeyGen Avatar IV?","answer":"HeyGen Avatar IV creates avatar videos from text or audio inputs. Select it manually on a video node to pair a script or speech track with an avatar image."},{"question":"How do I use HeyGen Avatar IV on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick HeyGen Avatar IV from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]},{"slug":"heygen-digital-twin","name":"HeyGen Digital Twin","provider":"HeyGen","category":"video","releasedAt":"2026-07-15","categoryLabel":"Video model","tagline":"Create avatar videos from text or an audio track","description":"HeyGen Digital Twin generates avatar video from a text script or connected audio. Select it manually on a video node and connect an image to guide the avatar's appearance.","capabilities":["Generate video from a text prompt","Drive a video from an input audio track"],"searchAliases":[],"faq":[{"question":"What is HeyGen Digital Twin?","answer":"HeyGen Digital Twin generates avatar video from a text script or connected audio. Select it manually on a video node and connect an image to guide the avatar's appearance."},{"question":"How do I use HeyGen Digital Twin on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick HeyGen Digital Twin from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]},{"slug":"seedance-2.5","name":"Seedance 2.5","provider":"ByteDance","category":"video","releasedAt":"2026-08-07","categoryLabel":"Video model","tagline":"Generate, edit, and extend video with multimodal references","description":"Seedance 2.5 supports text, images, video, and audio references for video generation. Connect a single video and describe a continuation to extend the scene, or combine references to guide a new generation.","capabilities":["Generate video from a text prompt","Animate a still image into video","Keep characters and products consistent with reference images","Restyle and transform existing footage"],"searchAliases":[],"faq":[{"question":"What is Seedance 2.5?","answer":"Seedance 2.5 supports text, images, video, and audio references for video generation. Connect a single video and describe a continuation to extend the scene, or combine references to guide a new generation."},{"question":"How do I use Seedance 2.5 on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick Seedance 2.5 from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]},{"slug":"minimax-h3-max","name":"MiniMax H3 Max","provider":"MiniMax","category":"video","releasedAt":"2026-08-25","categoryLabel":"Video model","tagline":"Video generation from text, frames, and multimodal references","description":"MiniMax H3 Max generates video from text, image frames, or a combination of reference images, video, and audio. Use it for reference-driven scenes and first-to-last-frame transitions at 480P or 768P.","capabilities":["Generate video from a text prompt","Animate a still image into video","Keep characters and products consistent with reference images"],"searchAliases":[],"faq":[{"question":"What is MiniMax H3 Max?","answer":"MiniMax H3 Max generates video from text, image frames, or a combination of reference images, video, and audio. Use it for reference-driven scenes and first-to-last-frame transitions at 480P or 768P."},{"question":"How do I use MiniMax H3 Max on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick MiniMax H3 Max from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]},{"slug":"veo-3.1","name":"Veo 3.1","provider":"Google","category":"video","releasedAt":"2025-01-01","categoryLabel":"Video model","tagline":"Google's flagship Veo video model","description":"Veo 3.1 is Google's flagship AI video model. It generates high-quality clips from text or an image, supports reference images for consistency, and can interpolate between a first and last frame.","capabilities":["Generate video from a text prompt","Animate a still image into video","Keep characters and products consistent with reference images","Fill in the motion between a first and last frame"],"searchAliases":["Veo 3","Veo"],"faq":[{"question":"What is Veo 3.1?","answer":"Veo 3.1 is Google's flagship AI video model. It generates high-quality clips from text or an image, supports reference images for consistency, and can interpolate between a first and last frame."},{"question":"Is Veo 3 available on Melius?","answer":"Yes. Veo 3 is Veo 3.1 on Melius. Select it on a video node and compare it with other models in your workflow. You only pay for what you generate."},{"question":"How do I use Veo 3.1 on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick Veo 3.1 from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]},{"slug":"gemini-omni-flash-1.1","name":"Gemini Omni Flash 1.1","provider":"Google","category":"video","releasedAt":"2026-08-27","thumbnail":"/images/models/gemini-omni-flash.webp","categoryLabel":"Video model","tagline":"Google's fast frontier video model at up to 4k","description":"Gemini Omni Flash 1.1 is Google's fast frontier video model. It generates and edits video from text, images, a start and end frame, reference frames, reference clips, or existing footage, at up to 4k.","capabilities":["Generate video from a text prompt","Animate a still image into video","Fill in the motion between a first and last frame","Keep characters and products consistent with reference images","Restyle and transform existing footage"],"searchAliases":[],"faq":[{"question":"What is Gemini Omni Flash 1.1?","answer":"Gemini Omni Flash 1.1 is Google's fast frontier video model. It generates and edits video from text, images, a start and end frame, reference frames, reference clips, or existing footage, at up to 4k."},{"question":"How do I use Gemini Omni Flash 1.1 on Melius?","answer":"Melius is a node-based canvas: add a video node, pick Gemini Omni Flash 1.1 from the model picker, and connect it to whatever should feed it or follow it. You only pay for what you generate."}]}]}]],["$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8"],"$L9"]}],"isPartial":"$@a","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Lc","isPartial":"$@d","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":"$10"},{"rsc":"$L11","isPartial":"$@12","staleTime":"$b","varyParams":"$10"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@13","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@14"}
